stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DraftReady: ComposerVm state=ready and action enabled
    DraftReady --> CommandAccepted: im_send_message receipt accepted
    CommandAccepted --> Local: PendingSend created
    Local --> SendingPersisted: optimistic SQLite PersistOk
    SendingPersisted --> SendingRendered: timeline Frame V2 applied

    SendingRendered --> SentKnownId: HTTP SUCCESS with serverId
    SendingRendered --> SentAwaitingIdentity: HTTP SUCCESS without serverId
    SendingRendered --> Failed: HTTP PortError
    SendingRendered --> AwaitingTimeout: malformed or non-SUCCESS reply
    AwaitingTimeout --> Failed: timer fire writes unsend

    SentAwaitingIdentity --> SentKnownId: WS post or recovery reconciles temporaryId
    Failed --> SentKnownId: late authoritative WS echo
    SentKnownId --> [*]

    state SendingRendered {
        [*] --> TimelineSending
        TimelineSending: CURRENT message.timeline delivery=sending
    }

    state SentKnownId {
        [*] --> TimelineSent
        TimelineSent: id=serverId delivery=sent eventSeq when known
        TimelineSent --> ChannelImpactEvaluation
        ChannelImpactEvaluation: compare changed facts and attached slots
        ChannelImpactEvaluation --> DialogLeftTarget: preview or lastActivity changed
        ChannelImpactEvaluation --> UnreadTarget: actor summary changed
        ChannelImpactEvaluation --> ComposerTarget: capability or draft policy changed
        DialogLeftTarget --> FrameTransaction
        UnreadTarget --> FrameTransaction
        ComposerTarget --> FrameTransaction
        FrameTransaction: TARGET one InteractionFrameV2 with only changed surfaces
    }

    note right of CommandAccepted
        AcceptedCommand is transport admission only.
        It cannot drive delivery state.
    end note

    note right of SendingRendered
        CURRENT producer proves timeline only.
        DialogLeft, Unread, Composer are not claimed current G01 mutations.
    end note

    note right of FrameTransaction
        ChannelFrame is a business shorthand,
        not a separate wire schema.
    end note
